<Base title="Hi, I'm Jackson"><section class="section page-head"><span class="eyebrow section-kicker">Behind the clipboard / Lubbock, TX</span><h1>Hi, I’m Jackson.</h1><p>A love for the game. A mind for the details.</p></section><section class="section about-inner" style="padding-top:0"><div class="about-emblem"><span class="initials">JD.</span><span class="eyebrow">Jackson Davis / Basketball analytics</span></div><div class="about-copy"><h2>It started with<br/>a better question.</h2><p>I’m the Video Coordinator for Texas Tech Women’s Basketball in Lubbock, TX, and a Synergy & Sportscode content partner.</p><p>When I was 19 and a manager at UNT, I built a Paint Rate report nobody asked for. It tracked how often we touched the paint and what happened after.</p><p>I’ve been building tools that turn film and data into coaching decisions ever since.</p><a class="text-link" href="/tools/">Explore what I build <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div></section><section class="custom-band"><div class="section editorial"><span class="eyebrow section-kicker">Always learning. Always building.</span><h2>The work goes beyond<br/>the final whistle.</h2><p>I write about basketball analytics, video and player development on Substack and X.</p><a class="button button-light" href="/blog/">Read the latest thinking <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div></section></Base>
